        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "title",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# Northpeak Lineage & Access \u2014 Governance Overview\n",
                "\n",
                "**The story** \u2014 three weeks ago a new materialized view **`mv_exec_revenue_daily`** was published. Its lineage fan-out spiked (18 new downstream edges), and it now feeds the **Executive Revenue Tableau dashboard** and a **$250K/yr finance workflow** \u2014 while reading from **`customer_pii`**, a PII table the **`all-analysts`** group (42 people) can read via an over-broad grant.\n",
                "\n",
                "**What to see** \u2014 the edge-trend line spikes 3 weeks ago (orange = the new MV's fan-out) \u00b7 the blast-radius bar puts `mv_exec_revenue_daily` on top at 18 downstream assets \u00b7 the Criticality \u00d7 PII matrix flags the high-criticality + PII quadrant where `customer_pii` sits."
              ]
